  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NGO Forum Sydsudan 2017-2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan NGO Forum 2017-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcome is &quot;Improved international and national non-governmental organisation (NGO) engagement in South Sudan in the delivery of humanitarian and development assistance&quot;. The expected impact is &quot;Effective and principled delivery of humanitarian and development assistance by NGOs South Sudan&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen utg&#xf6;r ett st&#xf6;d 300till South Sudan NGO Forum f&#xf6;r perioden 1 december 2017-31 augusti 2020, senare f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngd till 28 februari 2021. NGO Forum utg&#xf6;r en medlemsbaserad plattform med drygt 400 internationella och nationella icke-statliga organisationer i Sydsudan. NGO Forums m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att bidra till ett mer effektivt och samordnat humanit&#xe4;rt och l&#xe5;ngsiktigt utvecklingsst&#xf6;d i Sydsudan. F&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; detta st&#xf6;djer NGO Forums sekretariat samordning, kommunikation, p&#xe5;verksansarbete, kapacitetsutveckling, samt s&#xe4;kerhetssamarbete bland det stora antal NGO:er som levererar service och bidrar till fredsbyggande och utveckling i landet. Det &#xe4;r Sidas bed&#xf6;mning att NGO Forums verksamhet, som utformats av medlemmarna under m&#xe5;nga &#xe5;rs samarbete, &#xe4;r relevant, effektiv och motsvarar behoven i en f&#xf6;r&#xe4;nderlig och synnerligen utmanande kontext. Det &#xe4;r &#xe4;ven Sidas bed&#xf6;mning att NGO Forums sekretariat har erfoderlig kapacitet att forts&#xe4;tta genomf&#xf6;ra dess aktiviteter. samt att Concern Worldwide (som v&#xe4;rdorganisation/fondadministrat&#xf6;r f&#xf6;r sekreteriatet) utg&#xf6;r en tillf&#xf6;rlitlig samarbetspartner.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention provides support for the South Sudan NGO Forum for the period 1 December 2017 to 31 August 2020, later extended to 28 February 2021. The NGO Forum is a member-based platform with more than 400 international and national NGO members in South Sudan. The NGO Forum&apos;s goal is to contribute to a more efficient and coordinated humanitarian and long-term development support in South Sudan. To achieve this, the NGO Forum Secretariat supoprts coordination, communication, advocacy, capacity development and security cooperation among the large number of NGOs delivering services and contributing to peace building and development in the country. Sida&apos;s assessment is that NGO Forum&apos;s activities, designed by the members during many years of cooperation, are relevant, effective and meet the needs of a changing and extremely challenging context. It is also Sida&apos;s assessment that the NGO Forum Secretariat has adequate capacity to carry out its activities and that the Concern Worldwide (as a host organisation/fund administrator of the secretariat) is a reliable partner.</narrative>
  </description>
